// Bend-after gestures: @fall drops a curve away from the note, @doit rises. They
// render on both the notation staff and the tab (off the fret's string row).
part bl { clef bass tuning bass }
section A { c4 e@fall g@fall e@doit | c2@fall g4@doit r | }
form main { A }
score main { staff bl  tab bl }
